      "lang": "python",
      "code": "class Money:\n    def __init__(self, n): self.n = n\n    def __add__(self, other): return Money(self.n + other.n)   # 定义 +\n    def __eq__(self, other): return self.n == other.n          # 定义 ==\n    def __repr__(self): return f\"Money({self.n})\"\n\nMoney(1) + Money(2)   # Money(3) —— 真的用上了运算符\nMoney(1) == Money(1)  # True\n\"a\" + Money(1)        # ⚠ 走 __radd__，没定义就会 TypeError",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">class</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">,</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\"> n</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">): self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">n </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> __add__</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">,</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\"> other</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">): </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">return</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(self.n </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">+</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\"> other.n)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">   # 定义 +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> __eq__</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">,</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\"> other</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">): </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">return</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">n </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">==</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> other</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">n          </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 定义 ==</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> __repr__</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">): </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">return</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> f</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"Money(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">{</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">n</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">}</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">Money</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> +</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">2</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">   # Money(3) —— 真的用上了运算符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">Money</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">  # True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"a\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> +</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">        # ⚠ 走 __radd__，没定义就会 TypeError</span></span></code></pre>",
